  "production_changed": false,
  "finding": "The evaluation harness performs TWO independent graph retrievals. EvaluationRunner._stage_graph uses RunnerConfig.graph_depth/graph_top_k and feeds ONLY trace.graph_* metrics. The LLM prompt is built from the ContextBundle produced by a SEPARATE GraphProvider inside ContextBuilder, whose top_k defaults to 8 and whose depth comes from config.settings.GRAPH_RETRIEVAL_DEPTH. RunnerConfig.providers is None, so the runner never passes its graph settings to the provider.",
  "consequence": "Steps 10 and 11 varied a knob that cannot reach the answer path. Their GRAPH METRIC results remain valid; their answer-insensitivity conclusions were a harness artifact.",
